<title>USA: St Paul hogs off $1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul hogs off $1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00 lower. Top 54.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-250 lbs     54.00</p>
<p>	    250-260 lbs     53.50-54.00</p>
<p>	    260-270 lbs     52.50-53.50</p>
<p>US 2-3    270-280 lbs     51.50-52.50</p>
<p>US 2-4    280-290 lbs     50.50-51.50</p>
<p>US 3-4    290-300 lbs     49.50-50.50</p>
<p>Sows: under 550 lbs steady to 1.50 lower; over 550 lbs</p>
<p>steady. Top 51.00.US 1-3    300-400 lbs     44.50</p>
<p>	    400-500 lbs     45.50-47.50</p>
<p>	    500-550 lbs     48.00-49.00</p>
<p>	    550-700 lbs     50.00-51.00</p>
</text>
